  "title": "Waldencast plc Announces Fourth Quarter and Fiscal Year 2025 Earnings Date",
  "summary": "LONDON, March 11, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Waldencast plc, (NASDAQ: WALD) (“Waldencast”), a global multi-brand beauty and wellness platform announced that its Fourth Quarter and Fiscal Year 2025 earnings will be issued in a press release on March 13, 2026, prior to U.S. market open.",
